            "bodyHtml": "<div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jOog!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F348bbfc4-0ab2-4caa-b44e-0f4a090c84c8_1023x1187.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jOog!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F348bbfc4-0ab2-4caa-b44e-0f4a090c84c8_1023x1187.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jOog!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F348bbfc4-0ab2-4caa-b44e-0f4a090c84c8_1023x1187.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jOog!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F348bbfc4-0ab2-4caa-b44e-0f4a090c84c8_1023x1187.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jOog!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F348bbfc4-0ab2-4caa-b44e-0f4a090c84c8_1023x1187.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jOog!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F348bbfc4-0ab2-4caa-b44e-0f4a090c84c8_1023x1187.png\" width=\"374\" height=\"433.9569892473118\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/348bbfc4-0ab2-4caa-b44e-0f4a090c84c8_1023x1187.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1187,&quot;width&quot;:1023,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:374,&quot;bytes&quot;:3102997,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://mateuslucena.substack.com/i/196244642?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0c031f65-1ced-4395-9bd4-53d381cbad21_1023x1537.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jOog!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F348bbfc4-0ab2-4caa-b44e-0f4a090c84c8_1023x1187.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jOog!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F348bbfc4-0ab2-4caa-b44e-0f4a090c84c8_1023x1187.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jOog!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F348bbfc4-0ab2-4caa-b44e-0f4a090c84c8_1023x1187.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jOog!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F348bbfc4-0ab2-4caa-b44e-0f4a090c84c8_1023x1187.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture></div></a></figure></div><p><em>Manaus-AM, Saturday, May 2, 2026, 2:12pm</em></p><p>Maintaining a long-lasting and creative career in Brazil, a country that imposes obvious structural barriers to cultural production, is an achievement that deserves to be noted.</p><p>The latest release from <strong>Fresno</strong> exemplifies this resilience. </p><p>The song ‘O Cantor e o Taxista’, despite being a recent record, is part of an old piece of writing by Lucas Silveira, which has only now been finished and released. It is a reminder of the importance of having someone around who validates and supports our endeavors when the external scenario seems unfavorable and full of uncertainty.</p><h3>Lyrics: The Singer and the Taxi Driver</h3><blockquote><h2><strong><a href=\"https://www.letras.mus.br/fresno/\">Fresno</a></strong></h2><p>Oh, I won't talk anymore<br>I won't renege anymore<br>There's no time to waste<br>Neither for me nor for you</p><p>Everything will end<br>Just turn on the TV<br>Sorry for what you did<br>That can't be remade</p><p>Yeah, you can't measure<br>Compare your pain<br>With any other pain whatsoever<br>Every movie is horror</p><p>And who am I to stop me?<br>To be everything I am?<br>Well, it was difficult<br>That my heart shone</p><p>It was in a taxi that I took<br>I didn't even say hello<br>Because I was so lost and didn't know where to go<br>The man turned down the sound<br>He fired without hesitation<br>He asked: What face is that? And he started to tell me<br>About the war he fought, about the shots he took<br>And the friends he lost and cried over their coffins<br>And he asked again what I was regretting<br>But I arrived at my destination and left without telling him</p><p>That I have no home<br>That I wish I had problems like yours<br>Soul disease that I don't know how to cure<br>Because I don't want to see another day that was born<br>That's why I ask for this winter to end<br>The rains will wash away this sadness<br>It will take away from my chest what was there for a long time</p><p>I wanted to make history<br>I wanted to become a memory<br>If my time has come<br>I'm ready like I've never been before<br>I'm ready like I didn't want to be<br>I wish I could despair<br>With the idea of ​​stopping breathing</p></blockquote><div><hr></div><h3>Link to the video:</h3><ul><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TbrdZjjtelM\">Fresno - The Singer and the Taxi Driver (YouTube)</a></strong></p></li></ul><div><hr></div><p>Yours sincerely,<br>Mateus Lucena</p><div class=\"digest-post-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;nodeId&quot;:&quot;edd13659-d6cf-4259-ac72-1194e32b8be8&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Sábado, 24 de janeiro de 2026, 05:59 pm&quot;,&quot;cta&quot;:&quot;Read full story&quot;,&quot;showBylines&quot;:true,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;sm&quot;,&quot;isEditorNode&quot;:true,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;[Série] Indicações&quot;,&quot;publishedBylines&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:323090193,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Mateus Lucena&quot;,&quot;bio&quot;:&quot;-&quot;,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/09dbaa45-d659-4ee1-8c3e-af49abfd0b2b_640x640.jpeg&quot;,&quot;is_guest&quot;:false,&quot;bestseller_tier&quot;:null}],&quot;post_date&quot;:&quot;2026-01-24T22:07:19.951Z&quot;,&quot;cover_image&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/f03ac12a-119f-44dc-94a3-fe10318479a7_1536x1024.png&quot;,&quot;cover_image_alt&quot;:null,&quot;canonical_url&quot;:&quot;https://mateuslucena.substack.com/p/serie-indicacoes-de-filme&quot;,&quot;section_name&quot;:null,&quot;video_upload_id&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:185672041,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;newsletter&quot;,&quot;reaction_count&quot;:4,&quot;comment_count&quot;:0,&quot;publication_id&quot;:5952630,&quot;publication_name&quot;:&quot;Mateus Lucena&quot;,&quot;publication_logo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MD8Z!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffe748b16-c3f6-4bbf-b867-8661e59f211f_640x640.png&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;youtube_url&quot;:null,&quot;show_links&quot;:null,&quot;feed_url&quot;:null}\"></div>"
