            "excerpt": "Notes on the importance of frequency, tone, and behavior in professional follow-ups, ensuring clarity without being intrusive.",
            "url": "https://mateuslucena.substack.com/p/follow-up-conversa-em-movimento",
            "image": "https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!bCoE!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf9160ed-096c-4789-af7c-27f835fed3b8_1575x998.png",
