            "excerpt": "Investigating connection, engagement, and cognitive fatigue differences between video-on and video-off hybrid meetings.",
            "url": "https://mateuslucena.substack.com/p/camera-em-reunioes",
            "image": "https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!NqrX!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F95b13f7a-d08c-44f2-892c-bb7a6e4357f9_600x380.png",
