            "excerpt": "Reflections on candidate selection, coding assessments, and cultural matching from a hiring manager's perspective.",
            "url": "https://mateuslucena.substack.com/p/licoes-aprendidas-sobre-entrevistas",
            "image": "https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/aded3f50-df92-419b-a6c1-61d54ba83386_1536x1024.png",
